From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: krane <chris@krane.dev>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:36:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(settings): port end4-pC's Interface page

Port of pctrade/end4-pC dc2ca2600ee6: modules/ii/settings/pages/InterfaceConfig.qml
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/tree/dc2ca2600ee6d7852bf0ac91361db8e510f90a74
Problem: the ii settings app has no Interface configuration page; the fork has
one but targets features (standalone-window styling, niri overview, dock
background/media/pin/apps buttons, sidebar banner/bottom-group/media-player,
lock screen widgets/toolbars/media info, extra wallpaper-selector pickers,
hot-corner bottom actions) the pin does not have.
Port: hand-ported (fork-only Settings Panel styling, sidebar media-player card,
right-sidebar banner/bottom-group/media-player switches, hot-corner Bottom
subsection, Overview Style selector, Dock Background/Media/Pin-button/Apps-button
switches, Lock screen Widgets/Toolbars/media-info switches, Lock blur Samples and
8 fork-only Wallpaper selector controls dropped, see docs/II-INTEGRATION.md;
overview.orderRightLeft/orderBottomUp option values fixed from the fork's int
0/1 to the pin's bool false/true; "Agents tab" switch added for
sidebar.agents.enable); pin controls with no fork equivalent carried over
Drop when: upstream ships an equivalent page, or the settings port is abandoned.
---
